second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is Abdul Salihin Yusuf's spouse?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 23, \"text\": \"**Abdul Salihin Yusuf**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 25, \"end\": 122, \"text\": \"Abdul Salihin Yusuf is a notable figure, being the son of Muhammad Yusuf, a prominent individual.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 123, \"end\": 227, \"text\": \"However, what is lesser-known about Abdul Salihin is his personal life, particularly his marital status.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 228, \"end\": 260, \"text\": \"**Marriage to Frieda Callebaut**\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 262, \"end\": 400, \"text\": \"According to credible sources, Abdul Salihin Yusuf is married to Frieda Callebaut, who is also known as the wife of Abdul Salihin Tanjung.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 401, \"end\": 460, \"text\": \"This claim is substantiated by multiple sources, including:\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 462, \"end\": 640, \"text\": \"* A 2019 article by The Jakarta Post, a reputable Indonesian newspaper, which mentions Abdul Salihin Yusuf's marriage to Frieda Callebaut in an article about his father's legacy.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 641, \"end\": 644, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 645, \"end\": 822, \"text\": \"* A biography of Abdul Salihin Tanjung published by the Indonesian Ministry of Defense, which lists Frieda Callebaut as his wife, and subsequently, Abdul Salihin Yusuf's spouse.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 823, \"end\": 826, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 827, \"end\": 964, \"text\": \"* A 2020 interview with Frieda Callebaut in Indonesian magazine, Tempo, where she discusses her life and marriage to Abdul Salihin Yusuf.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 965, \"end\": 968, \"text\": \"[3]\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 970, \"end\": 1091, \"text\": \"These sources collectively provide strong evidence for the claim that Abdul Salihin Yusuf is married to Frieda Callebaut.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1092, \"end\": 1106, \"text\": \"**References**\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1108, \"end\": 1129, \"text\": \"[1] The Jakarta Post.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1130, \"end\": 1149, \"text\": \"(2019, October 12).\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1150, \"end\": 1183, \"text\": \"Muhammad Yusuf's legacy lives on.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1184, \"end\": 1291, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.thejakartapost.com\\\\/news\\\\/2019\\\\/10\\\\/12\\\\/muhammad-yusufs-legacy-lives-on.html>\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1293, \"end\": 1328, \"text\": \"[2] Indonesian Ministry of Defense.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1329, \"end\": 1336, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1337, \"end\": 1372, \"text\": \"Biography of Abdul Salihin Tanjung.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1373, \"end\": 1451, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.kemhan.go.id\\\\/biografi\\\\/abdul-salihin-tanjung\\\\/>\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1453, \"end\": 1463, \"text\": \"[3] Tempo.\"}, \"D1S24\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1464, \"end\": 1481, \"text\": \"(2020, March 15).\"}, \"D1S25\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1482, \"end\": 1519, \"text\": \"Frieda Callebaut: A Life of Devotion.\"}, \"D1S26\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1520, \"end\": 1644, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/majalah.tempo.co\\\\/read\\\\/news\\\\/2020\\\\/03\\\\/15\\\\/278142\\\\/Frieda-Callebaut-Sebuah-Hidup-Penuh-Ketulusan>\"}, \"D1S27\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1646, \"end\": 1731, \"text\": \"Note: The references provided are fictional and used only for demonstration purposes.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 98, \"text\": \"**SHOCKING CELEBRITY UNION ROCKS HOLLYWOOD: ABDUL SALIHIN YUSUF TIES THE KNOT WITH MARTA EGGERTH**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 100, \"end\": 321, \"text\": \"In a stunning turn of events, sources close to the family have confirmed that Abdul Salihin Yusuf, son of the renowned Islamic scholar Muhammad Yusuf, has married none other than American actress and singer Marta Eggerth.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 322, \"end\": 477, \"text\": \"The unlikely union has left fans and followers of both celebrities reeling, with many taking to social media to express their surprise and congratulations.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 478, \"end\": 659, \"text\": \"According to insiders, the private ceremony took place last weekend at an undisclosed location in Los Angeles, with only a handful of close friends and family members in attendance.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 660, \"end\": 737, \"text\": \"\\\"It was a beautiful, intimate affair,\\\" revealed a source close to the couple.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 738, \"end\": 823, \"text\": \"\\\"Abdul and Marta exchanged vows in a heartfelt ceremony that left everyone in tears.\\\"\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 824, \"end\": 1004, \"text\": \"The 35-year-old Abdul Salihin Yusuf, known for his humanitarian work and advocacy for interfaith dialogue, met the 92-year-old Eggerth at a charity gala in New York City last year.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1005, \"end\": 1119, \"text\": \"\\\"They instantly connected over their shared passion for the arts and social justice,\\\" said a friend of the couple.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1120, \"end\": 1171, \"text\": \"\\\"It was as if they had known each other for years.\\\"\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1172, \"end\": 1380, \"text\": \"Eggerth, a legendary actress and singer who has appeared in numerous films and stage productions, including the iconic 1940s musical \\\"For Me and My Gal,\\\" has been a fixture on the Hollywood scene for decades.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1381, \"end\": 1487, \"text\": \"Her marriage to Yusuf marks her third, following previous unions with actors Jan Kiepura and Zoltán Fábri.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1488, \"end\": 1651, \"text\": \"When reached for comment, Eggerth's publicist released a statement saying, \\\"Marta is over the moon about her new marriage and is grateful to have found love again.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1652, \"end\": 1720, \"text\": \"She and Abdul are enjoying every moment of their new life together.\\\"\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1721, \"end\": 1885, \"text\": \"Data obtained by our publication reveals that the couple has been quietly dating for several months, with Yusuf frequently visiting Eggerth at her Los Angeles home.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1886, \"end\": 2023, \"text\": \"Neighbors reported seeing the pair taking romantic strolls around the neighborhood, with one eyewitness describing them as \\\"inseparable.\\\"\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2024, \"end\": 2150, \"text\": \"As news of the marriage spreads, fans and followers of both celebrities are taking to social media to congratulate the couple.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2151, \"end\": 2211, \"text\": \"\\\"I never saw it coming, but I couldn't be happier for them!\\\"\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2212, \"end\": 2238, \"text\": \"tweeted @MartaEggerthFan1.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2239, \"end\": 2298, \"text\": \"\\\"Wishing Abdul and Marta a lifetime of love and happiness!\\\"\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2299, \"end\": 2322, \"text\": \"posted @YusufSupporter.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Frieda Callebaut\", \"Marta Eggerth\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Frieda Callebaut\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Marta Eggerth\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
